## batch shape — declared deviation
The comparators ran two arms concurrently (one per condition). This round has one condition, so
there is no interleaving to preserve, and three concurrent arms would expose a port interaction the
comparators never had. **The three arms run one at a time.** That removes a failure mode rather
than adding one; it does not reproduce the comparators' concurrency exactly, and neither choice
could.

Next intended action: launch q91 on Sonnet with prompt.txt verbatim, ARM_DIR substituted.

